! Game text
| Use X Force to deploy on any warrior where X = (7 - warrior's ability), and you may then use as follows: Add 1 to Force drain where present. OR Target a character by using X Force. Draw two destiny. Character hit if total destiny &gt; ability. || Use X Force to deploy on {{Errata hl|your}} warrior where X = (7 - warrior's ability). {{Errata hl|May add}} 1 to Force drain where present. {{Errata hl|May target a character or creature}} by using X Force. Draw two destiny. {{Errata hl|Target hit if total destiny &gt; defense value}}.
